I think you can specify as many as you want. With something like

  gheatmap(p, df,
           offset = 0.3,
           width = 0.5,
           font.size = 3,
           colnames_angle = 90) +
  scale_fill_gradientn(
    colors = c("white", "lightblue", "blue")
  )

